{
  "name": "metaontic-video",
  "version": "3.14.0",
  "description": "AI video creation plugin for DeepSeek Harness: Seedance 2.0 long videos with multi-segment continuation, image-to-video, text-to-video, script and storyboard review, segment previews, resumable generation and local FFmpeg merging. Connects through the MetaOnticVideo relay with email sign-in and wallet top-up, or your own MetaOntic AI key.",
  "license": "MIT",
  "type": "module",
  "keywords": [
    "metaontic-video",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "deepseek-harness-plugin",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "ai-video",
    "ai-video-generation",
    "seedance",
    "seedance-2",
    "long-video",
    "video-generation",
    "image-to-video",
    "text-to-video",
    "video-continuation",
    "video-extension",
    "storyboard",
    "ffmpeg",
    "new-api",
    "video-director"
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/wxsimon2022/metaontic-video.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/wxsimon2022/metaontic-video#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/wxsimon2022/metaontic-video/issues"
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "skills",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "logo.svg",
    "README.md",
    "README.en.md",
    "MetaOnticVideo使用说明书.md",
    "MetaOnticVideo使用说明书.pdf",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "docs/guide/*.svg",
    "docs/guide/*.png",
    "THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-tool",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-session",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-plugin-manager",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-api-remotes"
      ]
    }
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/node": "^20.19.43",
    "esbuild": "^0.28.2",
    "react": "^19.3.1",
    "react-dom": "^19.3.1",
    "typescript": "^5.9.3",
    "hyperframes": "0.8.223",
    "@deepseek-ai/schemastery": "~3.18.5"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "typecheck": "tsc -p tsconfig.json",
    "build:locale": "node scripts/build.mjs locale",
    "build:host": "node scripts/build.mjs host",
    "build:client": "node scripts/build.mjs client",
    "build": "npm run typecheck && node scripts/build.mjs",
    "preview": "node scripts/preview.mjs",
    "release": "node scripts/release.mjs",
    "clean:releases": "node scripts/clean-releases.mjs",
    "pack:test": "node scripts/pack-test.mjs"
  },
  "dependencies": {},
  "releaseNotes": {
    "version": "3.14.0",
    "prerelease": false,
    "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T01:10:29.148Z",
    "items": [
      "新增：接入方式新增服务端方式的临时下架开关，当前为下架状态：新装默认 MetaOntic AI，设置页与在线安装都不再提供该方式，恢复时改一个开关即可，其余代码无需改动。",
      "优化：接入方式下拉精简为 MetaOntic AI 与火山引擎直连两项，并去掉名称前的 A/B 字母标记，选项文字改为「MetaOntic AI」「MetaOnticVideo」「火山引擎直连」。",
      "优化：已配置服务端方式的安装不会显示空白或错位：下拉里该项显示为「MetaOnticVideo（暂时不可用）」并给出切换提示，原有 Key、额度与设备凭据保留；服务端登录表单、额度卡片与充值入口不再显示，后台也不再请求服务端额度与记录接口。",
      "修复：服务端方式下架期间，视频生成、续拍、图片处理（含真人参考图转换）与费用查询都会在发出请求前明确拒绝，并提示改用 MetaOntic AI 或火山引擎直连，不再带着旧 Key 调用上游；用配置工具把接入方式保存成该方式同样会被拒绝。"
    ]
  }
}
